           "type": "heading",
           "id": "307d8ca6",
           "tag": "h3",
           "text": "Analyse, optimise &amp; realise the benefit"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "column",
         "id": "1ef67d10",
         "size": "50",
         "elements": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "id": "5a004a7d",
           "html": "<p>Our solution approach centres on providing maintenance and Integrity Management strategies and activities which are aligned with your commercial requirements.  </p><p>We tailor activities according to commercial and technical drivers, exploring ways to optimise whole-life cost.</p><p>By deploying bespoke maintenance and integrity schedules for their assets, customers can achieve savings of up to 30%. </p>"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "section",
       "id": "2e7ff100",
       "inner": true,
       "columns": [
        {
