         "size": "50",
         "elements": [
          {
           "type": "heading",
           "id": "54df9eb2",
           "tag": "h3",
           "text": "Bringing together best in class capabilities"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "column",
         "id": "22477ec0",
         "size": "50",
         "elements": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "id": "214276da",
           "html": "<p>Our asset performance management solutions bring together industry-leading software, services, and business-process support &amp; consulting capabilities to give customers an enterprise-wide view of asset optimisation, helping them make decisions with confidence. Examples include providing visibility of real-time availability and reliability of machines and equipment, identifying potential failures early whilst ensuring compliance with changing regulatory requirements.</p>"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
